WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.600 --> 00:00:06.312
Hi! I'm Nina. Do you believe in ghosts? Listen to my story!

2
00:00:07.762 --> 00:00:10.734
Last Friday, there was a full moon.

3
00:00:11.184 --> 00:00:15.132
I was at my grandmother's old house, near the cemetery.

4
00:00:17.382 --> 00:00:20.447
It was very late. I was reading in bed

5
00:00:20.897 --> 00:00:23.358
when I heard a noise in the kitchen!

6
00:00:25.608 --> 00:00:29.323
It was raining, and the wind was very strong.

7
00:00:30.373 --> 00:00:33.252
I was walking to the kitchen with a candle

8
00:00:33.702 --> 00:00:35.607
when the wind blew it out!

9
00:00:37.857 --> 00:00:43.615
I was looking for another candle when I saw two yellow eyes in the dark.

10
00:00:44.065 --> 00:00:45.598
Was it a ghost?

11
00:00:47.848 --> 00:00:52.213
No, it wasn't! It was Grandma's black cat.

12
00:00:52.663 --> 00:00:56.332
He was sitting on the kitchen table, eating my cake!

13
00:00:58.582 --> 00:01:05.687
The next morning, Grandma said: "A black cat on a full moon? That's bad luck!"

14
00:01:06.137 --> 00:01:09.991
But I don't believe in superstitions. And you?

